<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/2026-10-20T001654Z-commercial-operations-domains> a prov:Activity , dct:ProvenanceStatement ;
  rdfs:label "Commercial Operations domains 0.1.0 created, 2026-10-20T00:16:35Z"@en ;
  dct:description "First release (0.1.0, Draft) of the Commercial Operations operational area: the container domain and six domains (sales; marketing, including competitive intelligence; legal, commercial and regulatory; customer success; pricing and contracts; partner and channel), each with its own vocabulary, taxonomy, ontology and shapes in its own folder: 156 domain primitives, 361 taxonomy concepts, 34 classes, 3 relations and 20 shapes (9293 triples). Built by build_domains.py from the domain specs against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0), which was read and not changed. Domains refer only to the core and the Commercial Operations container; domain ontologies import the versioned core ontology."@en ;
  dct:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" ;
  dct:contributor "Claude (AI assistant), at the direction of Jeffrey Wallk" ;
  prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-20T00:16:35Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
